# Shared Contract (`@ems/shared`)

- Framework-agnostic only — no React, Express, or Node APIs.
- Export enums and DTO/API types from `shared/src`; keep the public barrel in `shared/src/index.ts`.
- Changing a shared type is a **contract change**: update server validation + client forms/API usage in the same change set when possible.
- After editing shared, rebuild (`npm --prefix shared run build`) so client/server see `dist/`.
